.TH DANBY-DUMBBELLSATELLITE 1
.SH NAME
danby-dumbbellsatellite \- gravity-gradient attitude dynamics in orbit
.SH DESCRIPTION
The satellite centre follows a circular orbit while its extended body librates
relative to the local vertical under tidal gravity.  The diagram shows orbit and
attitude together; the plot compares orbital phase and relative attitude.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps, R resets, and Q exits.
